      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 7,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "收束半径与中心",
          "steps": [
            "系数 $a_n = \\frac{1}{n!}$",
            "使用比值判别法：$\\lim_{n \\to \\infty} \\left|\\frac{a_{n+1}}{a_n}\\right| = \\lim_{n \\to \\infty} \\frac{n!}{(n+1)!} = \\lim_{n \\to \\infty} \\frac{1}{n+1} = 0$",
            "收束半径 $R = \\frac{1}{0} = \\infty$，级数在整个复平面收束",
            "**收束圆中心**：$z_0 = 2i$",
            "**收束半径**：$R = \\infty$（整个复平面）"
          ]
        }
      ],
