      "math_structure": {
        "type": "power_series_exponential_coefficient",
        "template": "$\\sum c^n(z-z_0)^n$，$R = 1/c$",
        "variable_count": 1
      },
      "difficulty": 2,
      "estimated_minutes": 7,
      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "收束圆的计算",
          "steps": [
            "级数可写为 $\\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} 2^n (z+i)^n = \\sum_{n=0}^{\\infty} [2(z+i)]^n$",
            "这是几何级数，收束条件为 $|2(z+i)| < 1$，即 $|z+i| < \\frac{1}{2}$",
            "或用根式判别法：系数 $a_n = 2^n$，$\\limsup \\sqrt[n]{2^n} = 2$，收束半径 $R = \\frac{1}{2}$",
            "**收束圆中心**：$z_0 = -i$",
            "**收束半径**：$R = \\frac{1}{2}$",
            "**收束圆方程**：$|z + i| < \\frac{1}{2}$"
          ]
        }
      ],
